---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Kontak"
	description="Hubungi tim True Online Compass - masukan, laporan bug, dan saran."
	path="/id/contact/"
>
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 md:py-24">
		<p class="eyebrow">kontak</p>
		<h1 class="mt-4 text-display-lg text-ink">Hubungi kami.</h1>
		<p class="mt-4 text-body-lg text-body">
			Menemukan bug, menginginkan fitur, atau sekadar punya masukan? Kami membaca semuanya.
		</p>

		<form data-contact-form class="card-lg mt-10 p-6 md:p-8 space-y-5">
			<div class="grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
				<label class="block">
					<span class="eyebrow block mb-1">nama</span>
					<input data-c-name class="field-input" type="text" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Nama Anda" />
				</label>
				<label class="block">
					<span class="eyebrow block mb-1">email</span>
					<input data-c-email class="field-input" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="anda@contoh.com" />
				</label>
			</div>
			<label class="block">
				<span class="eyebrow block mb-1">pesan</span>
				<textarea
					data-c-message
					class="field-input h-36 resize-y py-2"
					placeholder="Ceritakan apa yang ada di pikiran Anda..."
					required
				></textarea>
			</label>
			<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
				<button data-c-submit type="submit" class="btn-primary">Kirim pesan</button>
				<p data-c-note class="text-xs text-mute"></p>
			</div>
		</form>

		<p class="mt-6 text-xs text-mute leading-5">
			Lebih suka email? Tulis ke hello@trueonlinecompass.com. Karena alat-alat ini berjalan sepenuhnya di
			browser Anda, sertakan perangkat dan browser Anda saat melaporkan masalah sensor.
		</p>

		<div class="card-soft mt-10 p-6">
			<p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink mb-1">Tentang kompas online ini</p>
			<p class="text-sm leading-6">
				True Online Compass adalah toolkit berbasis browser yang gratis: kompas
				<a href="/" class="text-link underline decoration-link/30 hover:decoration-link">online langsung</a>
				dengan utara sejati dan magnetik, koordinat
				<a href="/id/location/" class="text-link underline decoration-link/30 hover:decoration-link">GPS</a>,
				<a href="/id/qibla/" class="text-link underline decoration-link/30 hover:decoration-link">pencari Qibla</a>,
				<a href="/id/bearing/" class="text-link underline decoration-link/30 hover:decoration-link">kalkulator bearing</a>,
				dan
				<a href="/id/sun/" class="text-link underline decoration-link/30 hover:decoration-link">kalkulator posisi matahari</a>.
				Semua berjalan secara lokal - gratis, privat, tanpa instalasi. Lihat
				<a href="/id/about/" class="text-link underline decoration-link/30 hover:decoration-link">halaman tentang kami</a>
				atau
				<a href="/id/privacy/" class="text-link underline decoration-link/30 hover:decoration-link">kebijakan privasi</a>
				dan
				<a href="/id/terms/" class="text-link underline decoration-link/30 hover:decoration-link">syarat & ketentuan</a>
				kami.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>

<script>
	const form = document.querySelector('[data-contact-form]');
	const note = document.querySelector('[data-c-note]');
	const submit = document.querySelector('[data-c-submit]');

	form?.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {
		e.preventDefault();
		submit.disabled = true;
		note.textContent = 'Mengirim...';
		// Tanpa backend — formulir ini hanyalah pengganti sampai endpoint dikonfigurasi.
		setTimeout(() => {
			submit.disabled = false;
			note.textContent = 'Formulir ini belum terhubung. Kirim email ke hello@trueonlinecompass.com';
		}, 800);
	});
</script>
